      <button id="btnLPAdd" style="margin-top:4px">Add LP</button>
      <div style="font-size:11px;opacity:.7;margin-top:4px">Un add LP ≥ 10 000 POW et 10 000 USDC POW donne le badge session WHALE.</div>
